oup/status flex flex-1 min-w-0 items-center gap-2 py-1 text-sm text-left transition-colors cursor-pointer text-text-500 hover:text-text-300" aria-expanded="false"><div data-testid="tool-status-spark" class="relative h-5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 overflow-hidden w-0 -mr-2"><div class="pt-1 motion-reduce:transition-none opacity-0"></div></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0"><span class="inline-grid min-w-0"><span class="timeline-status-layer"><span class="truncate font-base">Thought for 6s</span></span></span><span data-testid="tool-status-caret" class="inline-flex shrink-0 opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 group-hover/status:opacity-100 group-focus-visible/status:opacity-100 -rotate-90"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: var(--font-anthropicons, Anthropicons-Variable); font-feature-settings: &quot;liga&quot; 0; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; line-height: 1; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 577.8;"></span></span></span></button></div><span class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite">Thought for 6s</span><div data-closed="" data-cds="Collapsible"></div></div></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 relative grid grid-rows-[auto_auto] isolate min-w-0"><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 relative z-[2] min-w-0"><div style=""><div class=""><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 [&amp;_&gt;_*:last-child]:mb-0 print:block print:[&amp;_&gt;_:where(:not(:first-child))]:mt-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr">Good questions — let's cover all three.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal" dir="ltr"><strong>1. Saving and adding the architecture diagram to your README:</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-find-omitted="" class="pl-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)] pt-4 pb-4"><div><div class="@container relative flex w-full flex-col overflow-hidden bg-surface-2 font-ui" style="border-radius: calc(var(--cds-radius) + 8px);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-sm p-xl"><div class="grid"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-sm invisible"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">1. Save the diagram image</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Right-click directly on the diagram image shown above in this chat → 'Save image as...' → save it into your project folder, inside a new folder called screenshots (create it if it doesn't exist) → name it architecture.png</span></div><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-sm invisible"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">2. Insert it into README.md</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">Open README.md in VS Code. Find a good spot (usually right after your project description, before 'How it works'). Add a heading and image line:
## System Architecture
![System Architecture](screenshots/architecture.png)
Save the file.</span></div><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-sm "><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">3. Push it to GitHub</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">In terminal:
git add .
git commit -m "Add architecture diagram to README"
git push
GitHub automatically renders that image inline wherever someone views your README — including on your repo's main page.</span></div></div><div class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-x-md gap-y-lg pt-md [grid-template-areas:&#39;dots_dots&#39;_&#39;toggle_nav&#39;] @[480px]:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(max-content,1fr)_auto] @[480px]:[grid-template-areas:&#39;dots_toggle_nav&#39;]"><div class="-my-1 mx-outset min-w-0 overflow-x-auto py-1 scroll-fade-x @[480px]:-mx-1 [grid-area:dots] [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden" style="--cds-outset-x: var(--cds-pad-xl); --cds-scroll-fade-size: var(--cds-pad-xl);"><div class="w-max px-xl @[480px]:px-1"><div class="relative isolate flex gap-md"><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to step 1" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-body font-medium peer transition-[transform,color] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none text-secondary active:scale-[0.92]">1</button><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-neutral transition-transform duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none peer-hover:bg-alpha-2 peer-active:scale-[0.92]"></span></div><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to step 2" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-body font-medium peer transition-[transform,color] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none text-secondary active:scale-[0.92]">2</button><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-neutral transition-transform duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none peer-hover:bg-alpha-2 peer-active:scale-[0.92]"></span></div><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to step 3" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-cent