Add a Screenshots section to README</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">In README.md, add a new section (after 'How it works' or near the bottom):
## Screenshots
### Home
![Home](screenshots/home.png)
### Analyze Food
![Analyze](screenshots/analyze-results.png)
### History
![History](screenshots/history.png)</span></div><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-sm invisible"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">3. Push everything</span><span class="text-body text-secondary">git add .
git commit -m "Add app screenshots to README"
git push</span></div></div><div class="mt-auto grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-x-md gap-y-lg pt-md [grid-template-areas:&#39;dots_dots&#39;_&#39;toggle_nav&#39;] @[480px]:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(max-content,1fr)_auto] @[480px]:[grid-template-areas:&#39;dots_toggle_nav&#39;]"><div class="-my-1 mx-outset min-w-0 overflow-x-auto py-1 scroll-fade-x @[480px]:-mx-1 [grid-area:dots] [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden" style="--cds-outset-x: var(--cds-pad-xl); --cds-scroll-fade-size: var(--cds-pad-xl);"><div class="w-max px-xl @[480px]:px-1"><div class="relative isolate flex gap-md"><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-current="step" aria-label="Go to step 1" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-body font-medium peer transition-[transform,color] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none text-accent">1</button><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-neutral transition-transform duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none"></span></div><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to step 2" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-body font-medium peer transition-[transform,color] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none text-secondary active:scale-[0.92]">2</button><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-neutral transition-transform duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none peer-hover:bg-alpha-2 peer-active:scale-[0.92]"></span></div><div data-ns-slot="true" class="relative size-7"><button type="button" aria-label="Go to step 3" class="relative z-10 flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-body font-medium peer transition-[transform,color] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none text-secondary active